  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audit for PHI385</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catholic Relief Services has been implementing the Livelihoods Recovery Programme for the period May 1, 2014 to October 31, 2016. The programme has a total budget of &#xA3; 1,204,281.62, funded by CAFOD/DEC. CAFOD requires that an independent professional auditor conducts an audit of the programme for the period May 1, 2014 to October 31, 2016. This audit should seek to assess compliance to donor and CAFOD accounting and management policies including establishing and assessing the effectiveness of CAFOD and its partners&#x2019; systems of internal controls. A copy of the Grant agreements and conditions will be given to the selected auditors.</narrative>
  </description>
